;TREATMENT OF N-ACETYLGLUCANS
THE THREE SUGAR MOIETIES BOUND TO THE ASPARAGINE RESIDUES OF A SUBUNIT ARE ASSUMED TO BE N-ACETYLGLUCANS THOUGH THE ELECTRON DENSITY SUGGESTS LARGER GLUCANS. IN THE REFINEMENT, HOWEVER, THESE MOIETIES WERE REFINED WITHOUT GEOMETRICAL RESTRAINS.
HYDROGENS HAVE BEEN ADDED IN THE RIDING POSITIONS
;
